      "versionNonce": 2344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: hold = Booking Service -> Redis (all seats or none,\nexpire in 10 min: TEMPORARY). Checkout = Orders (pending) ->\nPayment: 1 authorize -> 2 Tickets INSERT, UNIQUE (event, seat)\n(PERMANENT, the real guard against double-selling) -> 3 capture,\nor void if a seat was taken -> outbox -> Kafka -> email.\n\nREAD touches: Search index, Event cache -> Events (SQL),\nseat map = held (Redis) + sold (SQL), orders from the replica.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: hold = Booking Service -> Redis (all seats or none,\nexpire in 10 min: TEMPORARY). Checkout = Orders (pending) ->\nPayment: 1 authorize -> 2 Tickets INSERT, UNIQUE (event, seat)\n(PERMANENT, the real guard against double-selling) -> 3 capture,\nor void if a seat was taken -> outbox -> Kafka -> email.\n\nREAD touches: Search index, Event cache -> Events (SQL),\nseat map = held (Redis) + sold (SQL), orders from the replica.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
