      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EVERYTHING ELSE IS THE SAME AS ROW A: search, event page\n(CDN-cached), checkout -> authorize -> tickets -> capture,\nconfirmation email.\n\nWHY A WAITING ROOM: 1M people hitting 'hold' at once would\nmelt the booking path and fight over the same seats. The\nqueue admits K users at a time (as many as checkout can\nserve); everyone else waits on a cheap static page.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EVERYTHING ELSE IS THE SAME AS ROW A: search, event page\n(CDN-cached), checkout -> authorize -> tickets -> capture,\nconfirmation email.\n\nWHY A WAITING ROOM: 1M people hitting 'hold' at once would\nmelt the booking path and fight over the same seats. The\nqueue admits K users at a time (as many as checkout can\nserve); everyone else waits on a cheap static page.",
